---
title: "Sequence Diagram - Character Exchange"
---
%%=================================================================
%% Sequence Diagram - Character Exchange
%% RPG Character Sheet Application (target v1.2)
%% Two flows:
%%   Flow A (happy path): open modal + load link / copy.
%%   Flow B (import): paste URL -> validate -> resolve -> render,
%%   with the error (revoked link) branch via alt/else.
%% Red text = comments explaining the UML notations used (best-effort
%% in Mermaid: <font color="red"> in notes/alt labels).
%%=================================================================
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  %% ---- Notation comments (red) ----
  Note over P,M: <font color="red"><b>Actor:</color:red></font> external entity (Player) interacting with the system.
  Note over P,M: <font color="red"><b>Lifeline:</color:red></font> a participant over time; <font color="red"><b>activation bar</color:red></font> = busy.
  Note over P,M: <font color="red"><b>Synchronous msg:</color:red></font> filled arrow, sender waits; <font color="red"><b>return:</color:red></font> dashed arrow.

  actor P as Player
  participant M as CharacterExchangeModal
  participant SLM as ShareLinkManager
  participant IC as ImportController
  participant SLS as ShareLinkService
  database LS as LinkStore

  %% ========== Flow A - open modal, load link, copy ==========
  P->>M: click "Exchange"
  activate M
  M->>SLM: requestActiveLink(characterId)
  activate SLM
  SLM->>SLS: POST /characters/{id}/share-link
  activate SLS
  SLS->>LS: getOrCreateActiveToken(characterId)
  activate LS
  LS-->>SLS: token
  deactivate LS
  SLS-->>SLM: {url, token}
  deactivate SLS
  SLM-->>M: url + summary
  deactivate SLM
  M-->>P: show modal (link readonly + summary)
  deactivate M

  P->>M: click "Copy"
  activate M
  M->>SLM: copyToClipboard(url)
  activate SLM
  SLM->>SLM: navigator.clipboard.writeText(url)
  SLM-->>M: copied
  deactivate SLM
  M-->>P: "Copied!" feedback
  deactivate M

  %% ========== Flow B - import character (with alt) ==========
  P->>M: paste URL, click "Load"
  activate M
  M->>IC: POST /characters/import {url}
  activate IC

  alt <font color="red">alt</font> valid URL on whitelist
    IC->>SLS: resolveToken(url)
    activate SLS
    SLS->>LS: lookup(token_hash)
    activate LS
    LS-->>SLS: character_id | null
    deactivate LS

    alt <font color="red">alt</font> token found and active
      SLS-->>IC: character
      deactivate SLS
      IC-->>M: 200 {character}
      deactivate IC
      M-->>P: render imported character
    else <font color="red">else</font> token revoked / unknown
      SLS-->>IC: 410 Gone / null
      deactivate SLS
      IC-->>M: 410 Gone
      deactivate IC
      M-->>P: inline error "Link expired"
    end
  else <font color="red">else</font> URL not on whitelist
    IC-->>M: 400 Bad Request
    deactivate IC
    M-->>P: inline error "Invalid URL"
  end

  deactivate M